# Keep the build context small and keep local / sensitive material out of every image layer.
.git
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
frontend/dist
# malware corpora and local test data: never in an image
corporaphishing_pot
**/_local_corpus
backend/tests
# organisation-specific, untracked configuration (mounted at run time instead)
**/.env
**/.denylist.local
**/*.local.json
**/feedback.local.sqlite*
team-config
docs
images
*.md
